## Inventory Tools System

**When**: Adding a new item type that should be available via admin/testing commands.

**Required Actions**:
1. Update `src/app/bot/commands/invtools/giverandom.ts`:
   - Add the new type to the `type` option choices in `src/app/bot/commands/invtools.ts`
   - Ensure `handleGiverandom()` handles the new type
2. Ensure `src/app/bot/commands/invtools/give.ts` can handle the new type:
   - Verify `handleGive()` uses `item-service.ts` which should already handle all types

**Files to Update**:
- `src/app/bot/commands/invtools.ts` - Add choice option for new type
- `src/app/bot/commands/invtools/giverandom.ts` - Handle new type in random generation

**Purpose**: Enables testing and admin tools to work with new item types.

