## Command Registration

**When**: Adding a new slash command.

**Required Actions**:
1. Create the command file in `src/app/bot/commands/`
2. Export `command` object with `data` and `execute` properties
3. The command will be automatically registered via `register_commands.ts` which scans the commands directory

**Files to Update**:
- `src/app/bot/commands/[command-name].ts` - Create new command file
- No changes needed to `register_commands.ts` (auto-discovery)

**Purpose**: Ensures new commands are registered with Discord and available to users.

